    <span onclick="expand_section('safety_m','h2_safety');">Google Safe Browsing is a service provided by Google that helps protect users from visiting websites that may contain malicious or harmful content, such as malware, phishing attempts, or deceptive software.</span>
    <div id="safety_m">
<a class="gsafe_clean" href="https://www.google.com/safebrowsing/diagnostic?site=questlog.gg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" title="Google Safe Browsing"></a> <span class="gsafe_clean_warn">This site is not currently listed as suspicious</span>
