				<section id="ssl">
<h2 onclick="expand_section('ssl_m','h2_ssl');">SSL Checker<span> - SSL Certificate Verify</span><span id="h2_ssl"> &#9660; </span></h2>
	<span onclick="expand_section('ssl_m','h2_ssl');">An SSL (Secure Sockets Layer) certificate is a digital certificate that establishes a secure encrypted connection between a web server and a user's web browser. It provides authentication and encryption, ensuring that data transmitted between the server and the browser remains private and protected. questlog.gg supports HTTPS.</span>
